# Infozub Digital Academy

Phase 1 is the foundation only: Next.js App Router, the design system, shared UI, theme, linting, and a PostgreSQL-ready Prisma schema.

- Keep new UI on tokens in `src/app/globals.css` and `src/lib/design-system`.
- Import shared components from `@/components/ui` and `@/components/layout`.
- Use the `cn` helper in `src/lib/utils.ts` for class names.
- Do not add course, auth, chatbot, or billing features in this phase.
- Prisma models belong in later phases. Keep `prisma/schema.prisma` PostgreSQL-ready.
